WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.011
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:05.011 --> 00:00:06.004
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:06.004 --> 00:00:09.504
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.504 --> 00:00:09.872
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.872 --> 00:00:13.398
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:13.398 --> 00:00:16.903
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:21.514
Open a hint for the training intervention.

00:00:21.514 --> 00:00:24.839
Choose numerical parameters and read why optimisation changes the model.

00:00:24.839 --> 00:00:29.162
Move from training to the question about a new prompt definition.

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:32.453
Open the hint before choosing the second answer.

00:00:32.453 --> 00:00:37.931
Choose the explanation that the definition influenced inference through context.

00:00:37.931 --> 00:00:42.342
Use Previous question to review the earlier training explanation.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:46.794
Return to the context question with Next question.

00:00:46.794 --> 00:00:50.096
Advance to the final conceptual distinction.

00:00:50.096 --> 00:00:54.440
Open a hint for the final scenario.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:59.993
Choose the explanation that changed context can alter the continuation without retraining.

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:08.031
Finish the quiz and read the summary of all three distinctions.
